      summary: 'Review each numbered game, its gameplay video and the proposed Grindstone version. None of these proposals has been added to the active Games library or practice builder.',
      why: 'These games give players an opponent, a changing problem or a shared objective. The shortlist adds grip, balance, movement and team contests without turning ordinary repetitions into games through a theme or a score alone.',
