      summary: 'A blank inventory and checkout template for donated shoes, headgear and other club equipment.',
      why: 'Registration does not include practice gear. Donated shoes and headgear can help families, but supplies and sizes are limited; families should contact the club early. A consistent private inventory would clarify current availability, condition checks, loans and returns.',
